  "description": "A lightweight, encrypted, file-based database engine with SQL support, AES-256-GCM encryption, modern C# features, and production-ready performance for time-tracking, invoicing, and project management applications. Supports Windows, Linux, macOS, Android, iOS, and IoT/embedded devices.",
